{"book":"ezekiel","lang":"en","model":"glm-5.2","timestamp":"2026-07-23T08:43:17.539790208Z","verse":63,"ref":"ezekiel 16:63","tier":"glm-5.2","chapter":16,"translation":"So that you may remember and be ashamed, and there ⟨will⟩ not be to you anymore an opening of the mouth from the face of your disgrace, in my making atonement for you for all that you have done — ⟨is⟩ the oracle of Adonai YHWH.","tokens":[{"surface":"לְמַ֤עַן","gloss":"so that"},{"surface":"תִּזְכְּרִי֙","gloss":"you may remember"},{"surface":"וָבֹ֔שְׁתְּ","gloss":"and be ashamed"},{"surface":"וְלֹ֨א","gloss":"and not"},{"surface":"יִֽהְיֶה","gloss":"⟨will⟩ be"},{"surface":"לָּ֥ךְ","gloss":"to you"},{"surface":"עוֹד֙","gloss":"anymore"},{"surface":"פִּתְח֣וֹן","gloss":"an opening"},{"surface":"פֶּ֔ה","gloss":"of the mouth"},{"surface":"מִפְּנֵ֖י","gloss":"from the face of"},{"surface":"כְּלִמָּתֵ֑ךְ","gloss":"your disgrace"},{"surface":"בְּכַפְּרִי","gloss":"in my making atonement"},{"surface":"לָךְ֙","gloss":"for you"},{"surface":"לְכָל","gloss":"for all"},{"surface":"אֲשֶׁ֣ר","gloss":"that"},{"surface":"עָשִׂ֔ית","gloss":"you have done"},{"surface":"נְאֻ֖ם","gloss":"⟨is⟩ the oracle of"},{"surface":"אֲדֹנָ֥י","gloss":"Adonai"},{"surface":"יְהוִֽה","gloss":"YHWH"}]}